# Google Places API key — used ONLY by the LocationAutocomplete component in event
# creation and editing forms. Without it the component falls back to mock suggestions.
# The main event search bar does NOT use this key (it queries Supabase directly).
#
# Manual Google Cloud Console steps (do not automate):
#   1. Enable "Places API" in photomarkt-staging and photomarkt-prod projects.
#   2. Restrict the key to HTTP referrers:
#      https://photomarkt.com/*
#      https://www.photomarkt.com/*
#      http://localhost:3000/*
#   3. Restrict the key under "API restrictions" to BOTH:
#        - Maps JavaScript API  (loads the SDK)
#        - Places API           (the actual autocomplete calls)
#      The legacy `AutocompleteService` won't load without Maps JavaScript API
#      allowed — you'll get ApiTargetBlockedMapError otherwise.
#   4. Set daily quota: 1,000 req/day (staging), 5,000 req/day (prod).
#   5. Add NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY to Vercel env vars for both environments.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@photomarkt.com

AI_PROVIDER=
PLATFORM_FEE_BPS=
SITE_URL=